        $$i (1+\delta) s \left(\frac{\alpha}{i\cdot(1+\delta)} \right) - i \cdot s (\frac{\alpha}{i}) = i \left((1+\delta) s \left(\frac{\alpha}{i\cdot(1+\delta)} \right) - s (\frac{\alpha}{i})\right)$$
